    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以对距你30尺内的一名可见生物挥舞这张卡片以吸取其生命力。目标必须进行一次DC 17的体质豁免，豁免失败则受到4d8点暗蚀伤害。然后，你恢复等于目标受到的暗蚀伤害的生命值。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself and drain its life force. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=17]] saving throw or take [[/damage 4d8 type=necrotic]] damage. You then regain a number of hit points equal to the necrotic damage the target takes. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.\"</p>",
